Verified before it was parked, on 2026-08-25: `actionlint 1.7.7` — the version
`ci.yml` pins — clean over `claude-pr-review.yml` with the patch applied,
`shellcheck -x` clean over `.github/scripts/*.sh .github/tests/*.sh`,
`python3 tools/docs/check_docs.py .` clean, and `bash
.github/tests/review-published-test.sh` green in both states: 54 assertions
parked, 54 applied, with the last 25 reading the real workflow instead of this
file. What none of that proves is `claude-pr-review.yml` running on a real pull
request with the patch applied, which no local run can prove and which is
therefore NOT EXECUTED until it is deployed.

