+          # No `set -e`, and that is the fix rather than a relaxation (#240).
+          # This step used to read the comments, post a note and only then strip
+          # the previous head's verdict labels, all under `set -euo pipefail`.
+          # A rate-limited or 502-ing API on either of the first two ended the
+          # step before the third, and a new head that nothing had reviewed kept
+          # its `ai-review:pass`. The helper inverts the order and this step's
+          # exit status is the helper's: notification failure is a warning,
+          # invalidation failure is a failure.
+          set -uo pipefail
